                 <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showCaption\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><b>Low Angle（低角度构图）</b><br><b>从低仰拍人物和大只生物的场景</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-section-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-text\">MOVIE NAME: (Avatar: The Way of Water)</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"carousel-item slider-image item\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/worms-eye-view-shot-16x9-01-glass-canyon-1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n                    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"carousel-caption\" mbr-if=\"showCaption || showText\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showCaption\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><b><br></b><br><b>Low Angle（低角度构图）</b><br><b>仰拍高楼</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-section-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-text\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"carousel-control carousel-control-prev\" href=\"#{{sliderId}}\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n            <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n        </a>\n        <a class=\"carousel-control carousel-control-next\" href=\"#{{sliderId}}\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\